(7600729, 1227842, 67258, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this a current photo? The brexit vote was a couple of years ago. I''ll presume there are still protests going on to try to reverse it. (Nevermind, I remembered this is an extended editing challenge and you probably added in the slogans on the signs) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There was a major rally a couple of weeks ago  - but I reckon DistantColours has altered some of the signs - they are all facing in the same direction.  Those on the remain side become more disheartened the closer we get to Spring 2019.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Is this a current photo? The brexit vote was a couple of years ago. I''ll presume there are still protests going on to try to reverse it. (Nevermind, I remembered this is an extended editing challenge and you probably added in the slogans on the signs)   There was a major rally a couple of weeks ago  - but I reckon DistantColours has altered some of the signs - they are all facing in the same direction.  Those on the remain side become more disheartened the closer we get to Spring 2019.', '2018-11-05 04:39:45.000000', NULL, 0),
